---
arrangement: why-address-unmatched
when-used: The whole answer to a `dorc why <address>` whose address matched no site in the analyzed book. Value: the address as given.
why: 28L rul-full-driver-this-arc: a miss is a real answer with real words, and a reader who mistyped an address sees this sentence and nothing else.
---
-- book.sh --
#!/bin/sh
hork tune --profile web

-- replay --
$ dorc why nosuchcommand --book=book.sh
dorc why: no analyzed command matched nosuchcommand (an address is a SOURCE line:
`<book>:<N>` or a bare `<N>`).
